      "category": "people",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "During the 1980s oil boom, developers rushed to build luxury complexes with pools and disco clubs, dubbing the area “Swingersville” before the bust.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        23
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
