      "source": "https://gulftondistrict.org/welcome-to-gulfton/",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Since the 1990s, Gulfton has added a community college campus, schools, a park, a community center, a library, and a juvenile detention facility.",
